9.2.12 - Влкючение в множество

Работает как list compression
set1 = set([1, 2, 3, 4, 5])
set2 = {item for item in set1}
>>> {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}

set1 = set([1, 2, 3, 4, 5])
set2 = {item**2 for item in set1}
>>> {1, 4, 9, 16, 25}

set1 = set([1, 20, 2, 30, 3, 40, 4, 50])
set2 = {item for item in set1 if item < 10}
>>> {1, 2, 3, 4} 